      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADRENALINE BURST (1) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for three wins and two minors. Comes off a (22.08) win last time, scoring by 4 lengths in a Grade 5 over 390m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. NAUGHTY NORM (8) scored by a nose last time (23.02) in a Grade 2/3/4 over 400m at Mt Gambier. Has already won three times from this draw. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. ASTON CLEESE (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (22.46) last time in a Free For All at Ballarat. Solid record here winning five races. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from nine starts. Can figure in the finish. RELAX MATE (5) is worth including.",
